{"unit_id":"jing-hy__picturereader#card-zh","repo":"jing-hy/picturereader","commit":"00a1db0a36ac83b2b73ce0c6dbd50776cfd13b95","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"**picturereader**（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为纯文本模型提供本地图片读取、OCR 与修图工具。它在 DSH 注册图像工具，并可包装所选模型的 adapter，把图片转成可继续分析的本地文件；Web 设置面板可调整路由模式和 OCR。功能涵盖像素扫描、四引擎 OCR、批量分诊、文档逐页转图、图像编辑及可选视觉模型理解。适合在 DSH 中检查截图、照片和扫描文档的用户。外部 VLM 需启用并配置兼容端点与密钥；其他本地工具不需要外部 API。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:324-334","src/index.js:525-530","client.js:699-740"]}
{"unit_id":"jing-hy__picturereader#card-en","repo":"jing-hy/picturereader","commit":"00a1db0a36ac83b2b73ce0c6dbd50776cfd13b95","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"picturereader adds local image tools to DSH: pixel scans, four-engine OCR, batch triage, document rendering, and image edits. Its adapter wrapper turns pasted images into local analysis files; a Web panel controls OCR and routing. Optional VLM descriptions need a compatible endpoint and key.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:324-334","src/index.js:525-530","client.js:699-740"]}
